      ],
      "text": "Trigger The dragon is critically hit with a melee attack\n\n---\n\nEffect The dragon channels the rancor of Hell back through the body of their foe, overwhelming it with an infernal assault on the mind. The triggering creature takes 8d6 mental damage with a DC 36 basic Will save save. Holy creatures use an outcome one degree of success worse than they roll on their saving throw."
